[0.976143, "o", "You have interlock MCP tools. Do exactly this and nothing else: 1) call reserve_files with patterns [\"src/**/*.go\"], reason \"codex demo\", ttl_minutes 5. 2) call my_reservations. 3) call check_conflicts with patterns [\"src/main.go\"]. 4) call release_all. Then print one line per step saying what each tool returned.\r\n"]
